
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The SLURM CLI FILTER is now enforcing resource constraints as of:
August 3, 2026.

| PARTITION       | CPUS/GPU | CPU MEMORY / CPU (or GPU )   | GPU MEMORY |
|-----------------|----------|------------------------------|------------|
| dgx-b200        |       28 |  8    GB / CPU, (224 GB/GPU) |     180 GB |
| b200-mig90      |       14 |  8    GB / CPU, (112 GB/GPU) |      90 GB |
| b200-mig45      |        6 |  8    GB / CPU, ( 56 GB/GPU) |      45 GB |
| genoa-std-mem   |        - | 5632  MB / CPU               |          - |
| genoa-lrg-mem   |        - | 15872 MB / CPU               |          - |

For further details, please review our guide (on campus or VPN):
https://docs.parcc.upenn.edu/docs/notes/filter.html
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

